<http://data.silknow.org/event/4e43d470-d31d-3341-abac-1c436d449888>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Circ. 753 to C.-1920 are pieces of a similar pair of sleeves. The very fine embroidery never seems to occur in the skirts that belong to similar but later sleeves (see remarks on T.101-1950) and suggests that such sleeves were part of Astypalaean costume at an earlier date than the skirts."@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/f92bb5a6-206d-371b-95f5-28a712ffafc0> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Circ. 753 to C.-1920 are pieces of a similar pair of sleeves. The very fine embroidery never seems to occur in the skirts that belong to similar but later sleeves (see remarks on T.101-1950) and suggests that such sleeves were part of Astypalaean costume at an earlier date than the skirts."@en .

